                    "**Why:** ID reference attributes like `for`, `aria-labelledby`, `aria-describedby`, etc. must point to an existing element with that `id`. A broken reference silently breaks the association.\n\n**Fix:** Ensure the referenced ID exists in the template:\n```vue\n<label for=\"name\">Name:</label>\n<input id=\"name\" type=\"text\">\n```",
